# data exports (stay on the PC; back up with OWARIN-DATA)
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.ndjson
!_logs/*.csv
# large evidence/journal dumps in tool logs (> 5 MB; stay on the PC)
04 Design Tools/logs/**/evidence*.json
04 Design Tools/logs/**/*journal*.json
# B1-C 2026-10-07: log snapshots holding Meta-token-shaped values (stay on the PC, never edited)
04 Design Tools/logs/W2-20261005-01/before/04 Design Tools/OWARIN — LABEL TOOL.html
04 Design Tools/logs/W3-PROD-20261006-01/project-settings.json

